    {
      "_step": "OPEN-SOURCE YEARS FAIL CLOSED, and this is the one asymmetry in the set. Office years are self-reported either way, so an unstated figure merely fails a comparison. This figure is VERIFIED — dated from when a first pull request was AUTHORED (ADR-0019 §7) — and unknown must never clear it, or a minimum becomes clearable by having a link nobody could read. Alice stated no first pull request, so she is unknown, so she is out.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/search?skills=go&min_oss_yoe=1"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "body": {
          "total": 0,
          "inactive_hidden": 0,
          "ranked_by": "skill:go",
          "page": 1,
          "per_page": 20,
          "results": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "THERE IS NO PAY FILTER, and there must never be one. A hirer able to filter on what somebody expects would learn an upper bound across a few searches, and an expectation would stop being a floor and become a ceiling (ADR-0018 §5). An unknown key is refused rather than ignored.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/search?skills=go&max_yearly=9000000"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "unknown_filter",
          "items": [
            {
              "field": "max_yearly",
              "reason": "unknown_filter"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "evidence_within_months is GONE. It asked how old somebody's code was, which the scores already price in — and it was the only filter in the set that punished a contributor for a maintainer's merge queue. A stale parameter is refused rather than ignored, so a client still sending it is told its search did not mean what it thought.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/search?skills=go&evidence_within_months=1"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "unknown_filter",
          "items": [
            {
              "field": "evidence_within_months",
              "reason": "unknown_filter"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "per_page is capped at 50 — RFC-0008 §1.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/search?skills=go&per_page=200"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 422,
        "body": {
          "error": "invalid_query",
          "items": [
            {
              "field": "per_page",
              "reason": "above_max",
              "max": 50
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
